 "strings": [
  "",
  "Whatever the circumstances",
  "of the Earth Federation Forces,",
  "and whatever the technical history",
  "behind the MS,",
  "battles break out",
  "with no regard for any of it.",
  "Love, likewise,",
  "happens regardless of battle",
  "and bursts into flame.",
  "When Four flew into the sky",
  "aboard the Psycho Gundam,",
  "what she felt on seeing",
  "the Mk-II Kamille piloted",
  "was just such a feeling.",
  "These two had spent",
  "a brief time together.",
  "It was in Hong Kong.",
  "To ordinary people, a time so short",
  "it would merit a \"So what?\",",
  "but he and she alike,",
  "with a sense unique to Newtypes,",
  "had understood each other",
  "almost in an instant.",
  "Beyond ordinary love,",
  "beyond mere romance,",
  "to a deep, deep bond of souls",
  "that normally takes",
  "decades to form:",
  "they had arrived there",
  "in a single instant.",
  "Recalling himself and Lalah,",
  "Amuro put it into words:",
  "'That is a dangerous love.'",
  "Just as he feared,",
  "Four resolved to die for love,",
  "and Kamille forgot friend and foe.",
  "Kamille, out to intercept,",
  "forgot even his return to space",
  "and ended up forcing his way",
  "into Four's cockpit.",
  "Kamille",
  "\"Four, are you listening?\"",
  "Four",
  "\"If you were coming out,",
  " you could have just shot me down",
  " and been done with it!\"",
  "\"I'm coming over there!",
  " Open the hatch!\"",
  "\"Are you insane!?\"",
  "\"...Kamille...\"",
  "\"Four...\"",
  "\"That was reckless.",
  " In the middle of a battle...\"",
  "\"Four,",
  " I lied to you.\"",
  "\"Lied? ...You lied to me?\"",
  "\"I said my parents were",
  " in a colony, but that was a lie.",
  " They're both dead.\"",
  "\"They got caught up in the war",
  " between the AEUG and the Titans,",
  " and they died.\"",
  "\"And both of them, too,",
  " right in front of me...\"",
  "\"Right in front of you, Kamille?\"",
  "\"I used to live",
  " in Green Noa,",
  " in Side 7.\"",
  "\"I went to the high school",
  " there.\"",
  "\"My father was Franklin Bidan.\"",
  "\"He designed mobile suits.\"",
  "\"Even the Mk-II was his design.\"",
  "\"My mother, Hilda Bidan, was",
  " a materials engineer, and she",
  " helped develop the Mk-II too.\"",
  "\"My father had a mistress.\"",
  "\"My mother knew about it,",
  " but she never said a word.\"",
  "\"Why do you think that was?\"",
  "\"Why?\"",
  "\"Mother just liked her work.\"",
  "\"There was this girl I grew up",
  " with, and she'd always tell me,\"",
  "\"'Quit biting your nails,",
  " Kamille!'\"",
  "\"Always, 'Kamille,",
  " quit it!'\"",
  "\"I couldn't stand that.\"",
  "\"I mean, come on, Kamille",
  " is a girl's name.\"",
  "\"I hated it. For years...\"",
  "\"Is that so?\"",
  "\"It is.",
  " That's why I took up karate.\"",
  "\"I did Homo Abyss too,",
  " and I even built mobile suits.\"",
  "\"I wanted to get my hands",
  " on proof that I was a man...\"",
  "\"Kamille?\"",
  "\"I... what am I...",
  " What am I even saying?\"",
  "\"Four... why am I...",
  " why am I telling you all this...\"",
  "\"Kamille...\"",
  "\"Kamille,",
  " can I ask you just one thing?\"",
  "\"...\"",
  "\"Even now,",
  " do you hate the name Kamille?\"",
  "\"I like it.",
  " ...It's my own name, after all.\"",
  "\"I see...\"",
  "\"Let's go back where we belong.",
  " This place",
  " isn't right for you.\"",
  "\"...Do you mean that,",
  " Four...?\"",
  "In place of an answer,",
  "Four turned her gun",
  "on Kamille.",
  "\"Ugh! Four!\"",
  "\"Get out! Just go!\"",
  "\"Four...! But...\"",
  "\"If you come near me again...",
  " Come near again, I'll really shoot!",
  " Got that!?\"",
  "\"K-Kamille...",
  " does this mean I won't",
  " have to forget you anymore...?\"",
  "Woodar",
  "\"This is Lieutenant Woodar.",
  " All hands, stop work",
  " and attend to this broadcast...\"",
  "\"This ship's combat strength",
  " is next to zero.\"",
  "\"And yet we have no time",
  " at all to spare",
  " for resupply...\"",
  "\"The one means left to us",
  " is a suicide run with this ship.\"",
  "\"This ship will carry out",
  " a suicide run on the Audhumla.\"",
  "\"All crew are to abandon",
  " ship immediately.\"",
  "\"The suicide attack goes in",
  " when we catch the Audhumla.",
  " That is all.\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Hey... what do we do...",
  " At this rate, we're all...\"",
  "\"You men get going too.\"",
  "\"Sorry, sir, we'll go on ahead!\"",
  "\"...Now, let's see how far",
  " that Psycho Gundam gets... Hm?\"",
  "Woodar sat on the empty bridge.",
  "But the men he had raised",
  "from the ranks himself",
  "had come back to him.",
  "\"You men...!?\"",
  "Officers",
  "\"Let us have a hand",
  " in putting down the AEUG",
  " too, sir!\"",
  "\"...Right! All hands, to the guns!",
  " Keep the enemy",
  " mobile suits away!\"",
  "\"Roger!\"",
  "It was the madness of war",
  "at its most utterly pointless.",
  "Woodar's remorse",
  "at having burned Hong Kong",
  "likely came to this end:",
  "an atonement that dragged",
