  "\"What!",
  " The Psycho Gundam!?\"",
  "Amuro",
  "\"What's that black mobile suit",
  " doing!?\"",
  "\"I don't know,",
  " I don't know, but...",
  " Four...\"",
  "\"Lieutenant!\"",
  "\"Four's moving",
  " the booster",
  " for the shuttle!\"",
  "\"I'll take the controls!",
  " Bring us over the Audhumla!\"",
  "\"Sir!\"",
  "\"Ditching the shuttle booster",
  " to lighten",
  " the Sudori's load?\"",
  "\"Ensign!\"",
  "Officer",
  "\"What are you doing!?\"",
  "\"Stay out of my way!\"",
  "\"Waaah!\"",
  "\"H-hey!\"",
  "\"Augh!\"",
  "\"...Explain yourself!\"",
  "\"...I told you at the start,",
  " I'd do things my own way!\"",
  "\"You little brat!",
  " Can a manufactured Newtype",
  " still move after this, huh!?\""
